.TH SHADERCANDY 1 "February 2026" "ShaderCandy 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shadercandy-screensaver \- GPU-accelerated OpenGL screensaver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shadercandy-screensaver
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ShaderCandy is a high-performance screensaver engine delivering real-time 
procedural graphics through OpenGL. It features 25+ visual effects including 
fractals, raymarching, particle systems, and generative art.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-shader " " \fINAME\fR
Start with a specific shader. Available shaders include:
nebula, mandelbrot_set, julia_set, mandelbulb_3d, julia_3d,
starfield_warp, voronoi_cells, neon_pulse, kaleidoscopic_tunnel,
reaction_diffusion, fractal_zoom, liquid_gradient, bloom,
tunnel, plasma, spiral, ripples, checkerboard, gradient_waves,
flying_toasters, raymarch_sculpture, dna_helix, quantum_field,
fluid_dynamics, audio_spectrum
.TP
.BR \-shader-dir " " \fIPATH\fR
Add a directory to search for shaders
.TP
.BR \-window-id " " \fIID\fR
Run in an existing X11 window (for embedding)
.TP
.BR \-root
Run on the root window
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help message
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.B Right Arrow
Switch to next shader
.TP
.B ESC or Q
Exit screensaver
.TP
.B Mouse Click
Exit screensaver
.TP
.B Mouse Movement
Interactive effects (when supported)
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/shadercandy/shaders/
Directory containing GLSL shader files
.TP
.I /usr/local/share/shadercandy/shaders/
Additional shader directory (local installations)
.SH EXAMPLES
Run with default shader:
.RS
.B shadercandy-screensaver
.RE
.PP
Run specific shader:
.RS
.B shadercandy-screensaver -shader mandelbrot_set
.RE
.PP
Run with custom shader directory:
.RS
.B shadercandy-screensaver -shader-dir ~/my-shaders
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xscreensaver (1)
